    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/2aca1684ee709d1d4c072a3687b9f55f.poster.avif?t=1755757243\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/2aca1684ee709d1d4c072a3687b9f55f.webm?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/2aca1684ee709d1d4c072a3687b9f55f.mp4?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>It starts with fists. It ends in blood, fear, and power.</strong><br>A basement. A rusted cage. Sweat, blood, and smoke.<br>When the night falls, they bring cash. You bring chaos.<br>Fighters hit. Bets rise. Rules? You make them.<br>But the fight club is just your front. The real business is darker.<br>You plant the weed. You run the girls.<br>You move the guns. You own the streets.<br>Bribe the cops. Silence the rats. Bury the weak.<br>Each night, you grow. Each deal, you rise. Each enemy, you erase.<br>Territories fall under your control. Employees become soldiers.<br>You don\u2019t just make money\u2014you\u00a0<strong>build fear</strong>.<br>And in this underworld, that\u2019s the real currency.<br><strong>In this city, power is taken. And you\u2019re here to take it all.</strong><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Club Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betting System &amp; Spectator Economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug Production &amp; Sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Club Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Smuggling &amp; Black Market Deals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police Raids, Corruption &amp; Mafia Wars</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not a businessman.<br>You\u2019re a crime lord.<br>And this world either devours you\u2014or kneels to you.<br><strong>This isn\u2019t just a simulation \u2014 it\u2019s a criminal empire in your hands.</strong><br>Build your headquarters. Upgrade your operations. Control your people. Multiply your income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Fight Club Management</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/7caf5d06238aeaef493392d69298d6cc.poster.avif?t=1755757243\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/7caf5d06238aeaef493392d69298d6cc.webm?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/7caf5d06238aeaef493392d69298d6cc.mp4?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Drug Production &amp; Sales</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/f5b3989b5bad28edaf823e103c385b60.poster.avif?t=1755757243\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/f5b3989b5bad28edaf823e103c385b60.webm?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/f5b3989b5bad28edaf823e103c385b60.mp4?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Night Club Management</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/922e8887195708de7e48b92a81a02527.poster.avif?t=1755757243\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/922e8887195708de7e48b92a81a02527.webm?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/922e8887195708de7e48b92a81a02527.mp4?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/2aca1684ee709d1d4c072a3687b9f55f.poster.avif?t=1755757243\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/2aca1684ee709d1d4c072a3687b9f55f.webm?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/2aca1684ee709d1d4c072a3687b9f55f.mp4?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>It starts with fists. It ends in blood, fear, and power.</strong><br>A basement. A rusted cage. Sweat, blood, and smoke.<br>When the night falls, they bring cash. You bring chaos.<br>Fighters hit. Bets rise. Rules? You make them.<br>But the fight club is just your front. The real business is darker.<br>You plant the weed. You run the girls.<br>You move the guns. You own the streets.<br>Bribe the cops. Silence the rats. Bury the weak.<br>Each night, you grow. Each deal, you rise. Each enemy, you erase.<br>Territories fall under your control. Employees become soldiers.<br>You don\u2019t just make money\u2014you\u00a0<strong>build fear</strong>.<br>And in this underworld, that\u2019s the real currency.<br><strong>In this city, power is taken. And you\u2019re here to take it all.</strong><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Club Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betting System &amp; Spectator Economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug Production &amp; Sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Club Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Smuggling &amp; Black Market Deals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police Raids, Corruption &amp; Mafia Wars</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not a businessman.<br>You\u2019re a crime lord.<br>And this world either devours you\u2014or kneels to you.<br><strong>This isn\u2019t just a simulation \u2014 it\u2019s a criminal empire in your hands.</strong><br>Build your headquarters. Upgrade your operations. Control your people. Multiply your income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Fight Club Management</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/7caf5d06238aeaef493392d69298d6cc.poster.avif?t=1755757243\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/7caf5d06238aeaef493392d69298d6cc.webm?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/7caf5d06238aeaef493392d69298d6cc.mp4?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Drug Production &amp; Sales</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/f5b3989b5bad28edaf823e103c385b60.poster.avif?t=1755757243\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/f5b3989b5bad28edaf823e103c385b60.webm?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/f5b3989b5bad28edaf823e103c385b60.mp4?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Night Club Management</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/922e8887195708de7e48b92a81a02527.poster.avif?t=1755757243\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/922e8887195708de7e48b92a81a02527.webm?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847280/extras/922e8887195708de7e48b92a81a02527.mp4?t=1755757243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
